<view class="page home-page">
  <view class="brand row"><view class="brand-identity"><view class="brand-symbol">A<text>＋</text></view><view><view class="brand-name">安德鲁牙科</view><view class="eyebrow">ANDREW'S DENTAL</view></view></view><view class="account-link" bindtap="account"><text class="account-dot"></text><text>{{signedIn ? displayName : '登录 / 注册'}}</text></view></view>
  <view class="hero"><view class="hero-halo"></view><image class="hero-tooth" src="/assets/tooth-care.svg" mode="aspectFit" /><view class="hero-content"><view class="eyebrow">A LITTLE CARE. A BETTER SMILE.</view><view class="hero-title">微笑的事，<view>从容安排。</view></view><view class="hero-description">了解医生与项目，<view>选择适合自己的就诊时间。</view></view><button class="primary hero-button" bindtap="book"><text>在线预约</text><text>→</text></button><view class="hero-note">{{demoEnabled ? '演示排班 · 预约记录同步查看' : '查询开放时段 · 预约记录随时查看'}}</view></view></view>
  <view wx:if="{{demoEnabled}}" class="demo-home-notice"><text class="demo-badge">演示环境</text><view>医生与患者示例均有虚构标识，请使用合成资料体验预约。</view></view>
  <view class="home-shortcuts"><view bindtap="book"><view class="shortcut-icon booking-icon">＋</view><text>在线预约</text><view>选择时间</view></view><view bindtap="doctors"><view class="shortcut-icon doctor-icon">◎</view><text>医生团队</text><view>了解擅长</view></view><view bindtap="prices"><view class="shortcut-icon price-icon">¥</view><text>参考价资料</text><view>先了解项目</view></view><view bindtap="appointments"><view class="shortcut-icon calendar-icon">◷</view><text>我的预约</text><view>查看与改期</view></view></view>
  <view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}<button class="secondary space" bindtap="load">重新加载</button></view>
  <view wx:if="{{loading && !clinics.length}}" class="loading">正在读取门诊、医生与项目资料…</view>
  <view class="home-section-heading"><view><view class="section-kicker">FIND YOUR CLINIC</view><view class="section-title">离你更近的照护</view></view><text class="small muted">{{clinics.length}} 家开放门诊</text></view>
  <view wx:for="{{clinics}}" wx:key="id" class="card clinic-card"><view class="clinic-top"><view class="clinic-mark"><view class="clinic-cross">＋</view><view class="clinic-window"></view></view><view class="grow"><view class="clinic-name">{{item.name}}</view><view class="clinic-address">⌖ {{item.address}}</view><view class="clinic-phone">{{item.phone}}</view></view></view><view class="clinic-actions"><view data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="clinicDoctors">了解本院医生</view><view data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="clinic">预约该门诊 <text>→</text></view></view></view>
  <view wx:if="{{!loading && !error && !clinics.length}}" class="empty">暂无开放门诊，请稍后再查看。</view>
  <view class="home-section-heading"><view><view class="section-kicker">MEET THE TEAM</view><view class="section-title">先认识你的医生</view></view><text class="section-link" bindtap="doctors">查看全部 {{doctorCount}} 位 →</text></view>
  <view class="home-doctor-list"><view wx:for="{{doctorsPreview}}" wx:key="id" class="home-doctor-card" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="doctorDetail"><view class="home-portrait tone-{{index}}"><view class="portrait-head"></view><view class="portrait-body"></view><text>{{item.initial}}</text></view><view class="home-doctor-name">{{item.name}}</view><view class="home-doctor-specialty">{{item.specialty}}</view><text wx:if="{{item.isDemo}}" class="demo-badge">虚构医生</text></view></view>
  <view wx:if="{{!loading && !error && !doctorsPreview.length}}" class="empty">医生公开安排正在更新，请稍后查看。</view>
  <view class="reference-entry" bindtap="prices"><view class="reference-entry-icon">¥<text>资料</text></view><view class="grow"><view class="reference-entry-title">治疗项目，先了解再决定</view><view class="reference-entry-note">{{referenceYearLabel ? referenceYearLabel + ' 年资料 · ' : ''}}{{referenceCount}} 项项目参考价</view><view class="reference-entry-source">用户提供 · 未独立核验 · 以面诊方案为准</view></view><text class="link">→</text></view>
  <view class="home-section-heading"><view><view class="section-kicker">START WITH A CONVERSATION</view><view class="section-title">从一次咨询开始</view></view></view><view class="muted service-intro">以下为可预约服务及其本次参考费。完整治疗方案、检查和材料费用，在面诊后单独确认。</view>
  <view wx:for="{{services}}" wx:key="id" class="card home-service" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="service"><view class="row"><view class="grow"><view class="service-name">{{item.name}}</view><view class="service-description">{{item.description}}</view><view class="service-meta">本次约 {{item.durationMinutes}} 分钟</view></view><view class="service-fee"><view>¥{{item.priceLabel}}</view><text>/ {{item.unit}}</text><view class="service-book">选择时段 →</view></view></view></view>
  <view class="care-strip"><view class="care-strip-icon">✓</view><view><view>每一次预约，都认真安排</view><text>核对就诊人 · 选择门诊医生 · 确认时间与规则</text></view></view>
  <view class="footer-note">ANDREW'S DENTAL · 陪伴每一段微笑旅程</view>
</view>
